{"type": "FeatureCollection", "_source": "River centreline digitised from the detachment scarp to Devghat by Animesh Paudel (ORCID 0009-0005-3833-2718) and supplied for this study on 6 September 2026.", "_source_ref": ["paudel_centreline"], "_grade": "B1 (independent digitisation, one realisation of a braided channel)", "_licence": "Contributed by a co-author for use in this work and released with the package under CC-BY-4.0. He confirmed on 9 September 2026 that inclusion in the archive, the CC-BY-4.0 terms and attribution under his name are all as he wants them.", "_note": "The channel is braided and shifts within its valley floor between years, so this is a realisation and not a definitive geometry. It is used here for the headwater segment drawn in Fig. 1 and as an independent check on the traced headwater length. The measured geometry the analysis runs on remains the OpenStreetMap centreline in channel.json.", "crs": {"type": "name", "properties": {"name": "urn:ogc:def:crs:OGC:1.3:CRS84"}}, "features": [{"type": "Feature", "properties": {"fid": 1, "cat": 1, "DN": 1}, "geometry": {"type": "LineString", "coordinates": [[85.51571123598298, 28.270784512960606], [85.51505720376056, 28.271287933188322], [85.51390848386669, 28.27397679781292], [85.51370132274012, 28.274952754244623], [85.51344260134718, 28.2781839790347], [85.51424177246423, 28.280111723549112], [85.5141226376906, 28.282093816077314], [85.51444676877732, 28.28407513118793], [85.51444029078056, 28.28496888311791], [85.51389970055105, 28.28682768342395], [85.51278015352568, 28.28866733409767], [85.51264703720877, 28.290843514546722], [85.51209874221885, 28.29253362248514], [85.5092242352703, 28.29646107148631], [85.50844191402697, 28.29706769158401], [85.50722061564937, 28.29842323519694], [85.50632199063494, 28.300141444912775], [85.5045285518579, 28.301681868169386], [85.50333849295193, 28.303671876288334], [85.50209094722685, 28.305326960065834], [85.50075570194632, 28.306598331409592], [85.499643537